usage: krea2-infer [-h] [--name NAME] [--rank RANK] [--resolution RESOLUTION]
                   [--model_id MODEL_ID]
                   [--transformer_subfolder TRANSFORMER_SUBFOLDER]
                   [--transformer TRANSFORMER]
                   [--skeleton_model SKELETON_MODEL]
                   [--prompts_file PROMPTS_FILE] [--config_file CONFIG_FILE]
                   [--save_dir SAVE_DIR] [--steps STEPS] [--lr LR]
                   [--seed SEED] [--device DEVICE]
                   [--sample_steps SAMPLE_STEPS]
                   [--sample_guidance SAMPLE_GUIDANCE] [--mu MU]
                   [--hold_weight HOLD_WEIGHT]
                   [--gan_batch_size GAN_BATCH_SIZE]
                   [--gan_preset {bispf,bispf_optimized}]
                   [--lora_targets {dit,te,dit+te,text_encoder}]
                   [--lm_target {v,embed,velocity,embed_uni,te,text_encoder}]
                   [--recipe {uni,embed_uni}] [--dummy] [--live]
                   [--revision REVISION]
                   [--skeleton_revision SKELETON_REVISION]
                   [--save_every SAVE_EVERY]
                   [--sample_resolution SAMPLE_RESOLUTION]
                   [--final_resolution FINAL_RESOLUTION]
                   [--cache_seeds CACHE_SEEDS] [--resume RESUME] [--allow_hub]
                   [--control_prompt CONTROL_PROMPT]
                   [--sample_seed SAMPLE_SEED] [--load_te_lora LOAD_TE_LORA]
                   [--print_card]

Sample a Krea2 turbo-bbox slider from this repo. Uses the train entrypoint
with --load_te_lora, which skips the train loop and writes the smile-first
grid. No Hub download unless you pass --allow_hub on a live (non-dummy) run.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --name NAME
  --rank RANK
  --resolution RESOLUTION
  --model_id MODEL_ID   Hub repo for the turbo-bbox transformer (default:
                        jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox)
  --transformer_subfolder TRANSFORMER_SUBFOLDER
                        diffusers subfolder inside --model_id (default:
                        epoch-14-step-73184/transformer)
  --transformer TRANSFORMER
                        local Comfy .safetensors or a diffusers transformer
                        directory (default: None)
  --skeleton_model SKELETON_MODEL
                        VAE, text encoder, tokenizer, and scheduler (not the
                        bbox repo) (default: krea/Krea-2-Raw)
  --prompts_file PROMPTS_FILE
  --config_file CONFIG_FILE
  --save_dir SAVE_DIR
  --steps STEPS
  --lr LR
  --seed SEED
  --device DEVICE
  --sample_steps SAMPLE_STEPS
                        distilled sample steps (default: 8)
  --sample_guidance SAMPLE_GUIDANCE
                        distilled guidance_scale (0 is CFG off) (default: 0.0)
  --mu MU               distilled timestep shift, not a CFG scale (default:
                        1.15)
  --hold_weight HOLD_WEIGHT
                        historical MSE option; GAN uses balanced4:1
                        edit/preserve sampling (default: 0.1)
  --gan_batch_size GAN_BATCH_SIZE
  --gan_preset {bispf,bispf_optimized}
  --lora_targets {dit,te,dit+te,text_encoder}
  --lm_target {v,embed,velocity,embed_uni,te,text_encoder}
  --recipe {uni,embed_uni}
  --dummy               CPU backend, 2 steps, no Hub weights (default: False)
  --live                run real CUDA DiT conditional GAN training (default:
                        False)
  --revision REVISION
  --skeleton_revision SKELETON_REVISION
  --save_every SAVE_EVERY
  --sample_resolution SAMPLE_RESOLUTION
  --final_resolution FINAL_RESOLUTION
  --cache_seeds CACHE_SEEDS
  --resume RESUME
  --allow_hub           permit a Hub download on a live run (default: False)
  --control_prompt CONTROL_PROMPT
  --sample_seed SAMPLE_SEED
  --load_te_lora LOAD_TE_LORA
                        skip the train loop and write the sample grid for this
                        adapter (default: None)
  --print_card          print the distilled card and exit (default: False)
